Originally in '''Beta 6.6''', Gift Bear was a 5/5 monster that costed 5G and would summon a 1G 0/3 Gift with Taunt (which was nerfed to 0/2 in the very next update).

'''Beta 7.1''' nerfed Gift Bear itself by dropping both ATK and HP by 1, for a total of 4/4.

Stats:

ATK:
* 5 (Post Beta 6.6)
* 4 (Post Beta 7.1, Current)
HP:
* 5 (Post Beta 6.6)
* 4 (Post Beta 7.1, Current)
Cost: 5

Ability: End of turn: Summon a Gift.

Rarity: White (Commom)
